    "summary": "Use it in any phase, when a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit of yours that is not a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** is picked as a target by an enemy unit, or suffers a **mortal wound**; it is the target.\n\nPick another **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit of yours within 9\" of the target and **visible** to it. For the rest of the phase, as long as the picked unit remains on the battlefield, each wound a model in the target would lose becomes 1 mortal wound inflicted on the picked unit instead.",
